d data-colwidth=\"191\"><section style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">帐篷</span></section></td><td data-colwidth=\"191\"><section style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">2 顶</span></section></td><td data-colwidth=\"191\"><section style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">休息与遮阳</span></section></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"191\"><section style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">野餐垫</span></section></td><td data-colwidth=\"191\"><section style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">3 张</span></section></td><td data-colwidth=\"191\"><section style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">就餐与放置物品</span></section></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"191\"><section style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">饮用水</span></section></td><td data-colwidth=\"191\"><section style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">12 瓶</span></section></td><td data-colwidth=\"191\"><section style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">补充水分</span></section></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"191\"><section style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">急救包</span></section></td><td data-colwidth=\"191\"><section style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">1 个</span></section></td><td data-colwidth=\"191\"><section style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">处理轻微擦伤</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table><section data-layout-id=\"4\" style=\"font-size: 17px;font-weight: 400;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: 500;\">个人随身物品</span>：</span></section><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\"><li><section data-layout-id=\"7\" style=\"font-size: 17px;font-weight: 400;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\">遮阳帽和防晒霜</span></section></li><li><section data-layout-id=\"7\" style=\"font-size: 17px;font-weight: 400;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\">轻便外套</span></section></li><li><section data-layout-id=\"9\" style=\"font-size: 17px;font-weight: 400;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\">个人餐具</span></section></li><li><section data-layout-id=\"10\" style=\"font-size: 17px;font-weight: 400;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\">垃圾袋</span></section></li></ul><h1 style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: 500;color: rgb(43, 119, 191);line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 16px;text-align: center;margin-top: 16px;\" data-layout-id=\"11\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 118, 0);font-weight: 500;\">三、行程安排</span></span></h1><ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;font-size: 15px;font-weight: 400;color: rgba(0,0,0,0.9);line-height: 1.8;margin-bottom: 24px;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" data-layout-id=\"28\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><section data-layout-id=\"29\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">09:00 在公园东门集合，清点人员和装备。</span></section></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><section data-layout-id=\"30\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">10:00 到达营地，分组搭建帐篷。</span></section></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><section data-layout-id=\"31\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">12:00 进行户外午餐。</span></section></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><section data-layout-id=\"32\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">14:00 开展自然观察和自由活动。</span></section></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><section data-layout-id=\"33\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">16:30 收拾装备，清理营地。</span></section></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><section data-layout-id=\"34\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;line-height: 1.5em;\"><span leaf=\"\">17:00 集合返程。</span></section></li></ol><h1 style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: 500;color: rgb(43, 119, 191);line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 16px;text-align: center;margin-top: 16px;\" data-layout-id=\"35\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 118, 0);font-weight: 500;\">四、摄影打卡</span></span></h1><section data-layout-id=\"36\" style=\"font-size: 17px;font-weight: 400;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\">午餐后安排 20 分钟拍照时间，参与者可以在营地入口和草地区域合影。照片由活动结束后的值日人员统一整理。</span></section><h1 style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: 500;color: rgb(43, 119, 191);line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 16px;text-align: center;margin-top: 16px;\" data-layout-id=\"37\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 118, 0);font-weight: 500;\">五、安全与环保</span></span></h1><section data-layout-id=\"38\" style=\"font-size: 17px;font-weight: 400;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\">出发前查看天气预报，遇到雷雨或大风天气时取消活动。活动过程中不要单独离队，儿童应由家长陪同。</span></section><section data-layout-id=\"39\" style=\"font-size: 17px;font-weight: 400;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-top: 8px;\"><span leaf=\"\">离开营地前，请带走全部垃圾，检查是否遗漏个人物品，并恢复场地原貌。</span></section><h1 style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: 500;color: rgb(43, 119, 191);line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 16px;text-align: center;margin-top: 16px;\" data-layout-id=\"40\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 118, 0);font-weight: 500;\">六、活动记录示例</span></span></h1><se